ts":[{"date":"2026-10-13","type":"listing","what":"私募新股上市","what_en":"Listing of private placement shares","ann":"11682593","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11682593","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-11-11","type":"listing","what":"私募新股上市","what_en":"Listing of private placement shares","ann":"11699361","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11699361","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-11-30","type":"results_due","what":"下一季 (9 月底结束) 季报最迟公布日 · 交易所规定","what_en":"Deadline for the quarter ending Sep (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"}],"recent_en":"PUC Berhad recently completed two tranches of private placement, issuing approximately 305 million new shares, which resulted in Genting Berhad and Genting Plantations Berhad ceasing to be substantial shareholders. The company also proposed to dispose of 100% equity interest in its wholly-owned subsidiary PUC Capital Sdn. Bhd. and varied the terms of the disposal. Latest quarterly revenue rose 116.9% QoQ but fell 30.8% YoY, with a net loss of RM2.59 million.","notable_en":["Completed private placement, issuing approximately 305 million new shares at RM0.045 per share.","Genting Berhad and Genting Plantations Berhad ceased to be substantial shareholders due to placement dilution.","Proposed disposal of 100% equity interest in wholly-owned subsidiary PUC Capital Sdn. Bhd., with a deed of variation to amend terms."],"risks_en":["Private placement diluted existing shareholders' equity.","The company still recorded a net loss of RM2.59 million in the latest quarter.","Genting Berhad and Genting Plantations Berhad ceased to be substantial shareholders after the private placement."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 30 June 2026, revenue was RM14.28 million, up 116.9% QoQ but down 30.8% YoY; net loss was RM2.59 million with a net margin of -18.1%, narrower than -29.2% in the previous quarter but a significant widening from the net loss in the same quarter last year."}